  "comment": "POP3 ( Post Office Protocol version 3 ) is a protocol used to retrieve electronic mail (email) from an email server . This protocol is closely related to the SMTP protocol, where the SMTP protocol is useful for sending electronic mail from the sender's computer to the server . The POP3 protocol was created because the design of the electronic mail system requires the existence of an email server",
